<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
information concerning the total compensation earned during 2025 by HUB&rsquo;s five most highly-compensated office holders (as defined
in the Israeli Companies Law), including base salary, share-based compensation, directors&rsquo; fees (where applicable) and all other
compensation, please see &ldquo;Item 6.B. Compensation of Officers and Directors&rdquo; to our Annual Report on Form 20-F for the year
ended December 31, 2025, filed with the SEC on July 17, 2026 (the &ldquo;<B>2025 Annual Report</B>&rdquo;), a copy of which is available
at the &ldquo;Company-Investor Relations&rdquo; section of our website at https://hub-technologies.com or on the SEC&rsquo;s website
at www.sec.gov. Information contained on or accessible through our website or the SEC&rsquo;s website is not a part of this proxy statement,
and the inclusion of the website addresses in this proxy statement is an inactive textual reference only.<FONT STYLE="font-variant: small-caps"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></FONT></P>

